r copy's node stays at its prior since it's a separate input, so defecting dominates and the letter should be sent.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9015,"completion_tokens":699,"total_tokens":9714,"cost":0.05004,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.05004,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.03606,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.01398},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":385,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}